<title>GREECE: DRACHMA FIRMS VS DOLLAR, DROPS VS MARK AT FIX.</title>
<headline>DRACHMA FIRMS VS DOLLAR, DROPS VS MARK AT FIX.</headline>
<text>
<p>1130 GMT: The drachma firmed against the dollar but eased</p>
<p>against the mark at the Bank of Greece's daily fix, Commercial</p>
<p>Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>** Dollar set at 290.510 drachmas from Tuesday's 290.920</p>
<p>** Mark set at 157.025 drachmas from previous 156.400 fix</p>
<p>** Ecu set at 308.320 drachmas from previous 307.800 fix</p>
<p>** Spot dollar quoted around 289.76/86 against the drachma and</p>
<p>spot mark at 157.00/05 drachmas.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
